# Captures: opening on the idle card without the glance, so the simulator
# opens straight on the app (see StretchShot.mc). For another screen,
# CIQ_SHOT_JUNGLE="monkey.jungle;shot-<screen>.jungle".
base.excludeAnnotations = live;glanceview;shothold;shotsetup;shotreps;shotpush;shotbreathe;shotdone
